graph TD
    A["Agent<br/>(OpenAI or Demo)"] -->|AgentStep| B["HarnessOrchestrator<br/>(Main Loop)"]

    B -->|check| C["PermissionEngine"]
    C -->|metadata from| D["ToolRegistry<br/>(ALLOW/REQUIRE_APPROVAL/DENY)"]

    B -->|create/resolve| E["ApprovalEngine<br/>(DB + HTTP)"]
    E -->|pause run| F["UI Approval Modal<br/>(User Decision)"]
    F -->|resume| B

    B -->|execute| G["Tool Executor<br/>(web_search, send_email,<br/>calculator, delete_record)"]
    G -->|tool result| B

    B -->|record| H["TraceRecorder<br/>(Events)"]
    H -->|stream| I["SSE Event Bus<br/>(Frontend)"]
    H -->|persist| J["TraceEvent Table<br/>(DB)"]

    B -->|retry/fallback| K["ModelRouter<br/>(Primary/Secondary Model)"]
    K -->|model failure| L["RetryEngine<br/>(MAX_ATTEMPTS, Backoff)"]

    B -->|track| M["BudgetTracker<br/>(Tokens, Cost)"]
    M -->|check| N["Budget Enforcement<br/>(Warn at 80%, Stop at 100%)"]

    B -->|on completion| O["Evaluator<br/>(6 Criteria)"]
    O -->|score| P["Evaluation Table<br/>(DB)"]

    Q["Run Entity<br/>(Status, Tokens, Cost,<br/>Latency, Tool Calls)"]

    B -.->|update| Q
    E -.->|link to| Q
    H -.->|link to| Q
    P -.->|link to| Q

    style B fill:#ff6b6b
    style C fill:#4ecdc4
    style E fill:#45b7d1
    style H fill:#96ceb4
    style K fill:#ffeaa7
    style M fill:#dfe6e9
    style O fill:#a29bfe
    style A fill:#6c5ce7
    style G fill:#00b894
